{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42089","headline":"海上和柴军使清明书事 · 李中","name":"海上和柴军使清明书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清明时节好烟光，英杰高吟兴味长。\n捧日即应还禁卫，当春何惜醉朐阳。\n千山过雨难藏翠，百卉临风不藉香。\n却是旅人凄屑甚，夜来魂梦到家乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}